ides/how-to-write-an-abstract/\">How to write an abstract\n\n  <i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help-guide/how-to-write-a-research-gap-for-a-literature-review/\">How to write a research gap for a literature review?\n\n  <i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li>\n\n<li><a href=\"/help-guide/study-guides/guidelines-for-writing-a-literature-review/\">Guidelines For Writing A Literature Review\n  <i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help-guide/study-guides/writing-literature-review/\">Writing Literature Review\n  <i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help-guide/study-guides/step-by-step-guidelines-for-masters-writing-literature-review/\">Step by Step Guidelines for Masters Writing Literature Review\n  <i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help-guide/study-guides/how-to-write-an-introduction-for-master-dissertation/\">How to write an Introduction for Master dissertation\n <i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help-guide/study-guides/how-to-write-a-background-for-the-dissertation/\">How to write a background for the Dissertation\n <i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/help-guide/study-guides/what-are-the-struggles-while-choosing-the-best-uk-dissertation-topics/\">What are the struggles while choosing the best UK dissertation topics? <i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<button class=\"accordion\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid #ECECEC;padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;background: none !important;text-align: left;background: #071d37 !important;font-size: 16px;padding-left: 2%;margin-bottom: 0;font-weight: 500;color: #fff !important;padding-top: 2%;padding-bottom: 2%;\">\n<a href=\"/help-guide/study-guides/assignment/\"style=